              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are provided with Shift Requests\n {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CRITICAL_REQUESTS.$output}} \nToday: {{$context.$system.$currentDate}}\nShiftDate:  ShiftDate attribute of each item in {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CRITICAL_REQUESTS.$output.ShiftDate}}.\n\nYour task: Analyze this data to identify requests with highest priority and which needs immediate attention.\n\nGenerate high priority actionable insights for the TOP 5 request only (or fewer if less are available).\n\nFor each request, use the following information:\n  title: \"<Transaction Name>\",\n  shortDescription: \"<Concise explanation of specific risk factors indicating why this request is important>\",\n  actionText: If  {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CRITICAL_REQUESTS.$output}.ProcessName}  contains \"\"Approve Shift Drop \", then actionText should be \"Approve and Reassign Shift\". Else \"Approve\",\n  followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(performAction, Approve({\\\"TransactionId\\\":\\\" {{$context.$variables.TodaysShiftPriorities.TransactionId}}\\\",\\\"ProcessName\\\":\\\" {{ $context.$nodes.FETCH_CRITICAL_REQUESTS.$output.ProcessName}}\\\"}))\",\n\"priority\": true\n\nRequirements:\n- Return ONLY requests with \"ShiftDate\" as {{$context.$system.$currentDate}} \n- Replace <Transaction Name> with the actual Name value from the data\n- Replace <transactionId> with the actual transaction ID from the data\n- Prioritize requests by severity of date and time (highest risk first)\n- Keep shortDescription focused and specific (mention concrete indicators like Submitter, Submit date, Job, Department etc.)\n- Do not include ShiftDate, shift date, Assignee and Approver details in the description.\n- Generate MAXIMUM 5 insights even if more requests exist\n- Each insight must be independently actionable.\n- Display all dates in {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERPREFERENCES.$output.items[0].DateFormat}}  format only.\n\n** Following insight SHOULD BE THE ONLY insight at panel level **\nTitle : 'Publish Overdue Schedules\"\nactionText : 'Publish Overdue Schedules' \nfollowUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(publishOverdueSchedules,bulkPublish)\"\npriority: \"false\"\nOutput format: Return only the insight objects, nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
