              "id": "1768368677457_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Data:\n {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_SCHEDULE_DETAILS.$output.result }}\n\nTasks :\n\n-HeaderParam: Get DepartmentName, LocationName, StartDate, EndDate for each schedule. Set it as header.\n-DescriptionParam: Generate one line summary of schedule info using StatusMeaning, PublishDueDate, ViolationsCount,ScheduledHours, Variance\n-Only provide output of the filled parameter values. Do not display any additional text.\nFill the parameters in {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}}"
            }
